Description: game library manager for your computers and handhelds
 Pythia tracks which versions of which games exist on which of your computers
 and handhelds, where you own them, and what each one needs to run. While it
 runs, it is this computer's droidtop agent: paired droidtop handhelds sync
 their library and saves with it.
 .
 Its window needs PySide6 (the python3-pyside6.* packages, or pip); without
 it the command line works. Pythia is largely based on Lutris.
